<title>UK: Carclo names Kennedy non-executive chairman.</title>
<headline>Carclo names Kennedy non-executive chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carclo Engineering Group Plc on Monday said it named George Kennedy as non-executive chairman, effective January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Kennedy, who is currently deputy chairman, will succeed John Ewart, who previously announced his intention to retire on January 1.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
